{
	"name": "Bi-way: appointment reminder with quick replies",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "### How it works\nHelps practices, garages and other businesses that work by appointment reduce no-shows. Every evening, the workflow reads tomorrow's appointments from a Google Sheet and sends a reminder by RCS with **Confirm**, **Cancel** and **Call me** buttons, or an SMS asking for YES or NO. A second entry point handles each answer: it updates `Status`, answers the customer, and emails your team for a cancellation or a call back.\n\nThe reminder only confirms: no online rebooking, your team calls back to find another time.\n\n**Limits:** RCS only reaches French mobile operators. The sheet is matched on `Phone`: keep one appointment per number. A refused number does not stop the others. Running the reminder twice sends it twice.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the verified **Bi-way** community node (`n8n-nodes-biway-messenger`, [instructions](https://github.com/pocket-communication/n8n-nodes-biway-messenger#installation)). Tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.45.4.\n2. Create a **Bi-Way API** credential with an API key from Bi-way › Settings › Security.\n3. Create a Google Sheet with a tab **Appointments** and the columns `Date` (YYYY-MM-DD), `Time`, `First name`, `Phone` (e.g. +33612345678) and `Status`, as **Plain text**. Add your Google Sheets credential and replace `YOUR_SHEET_ID` in the three sheet nodes.\n4. Add an SMTP credential and replace `team@example.com`.\n5. RCS needs an agent launched by the French operators (check with RCS Agent › Get Status). Without one, set the Bi-way nodes to your SMS channel; buttons are left out.\n6. Your n8n must be reachable over HTTPS. Publish the workflow: the trigger registers its webhook by itself.\n\n### Customization\nChange the time in **Every day at 6 pm** and the wording in **Send the reminder**. A fallback SMS written in the node holds 114 characters with the STOP mention and chat link; turn them off in **Fallback SMS Options** for up to 160.",
				"height": 640,
				"width": 620
			},
			"id": "a7e118d4-47c8-500e-a192-0bb19885a691",
			"name": "Overview",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-710,
				-130
			]
		},
